{
  "headline": "Oxycodone and acetaminophen is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale sites hold 13.9 to 31.6 days on hand; Bryant Ranch Prepack label linked to plant with OAI in 2009 and VAI in 2026-07-16",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D1", "D2", "D3", "E16", "E6", "E14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows oxycodone and acetaminophen is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 526 tablets at 16.6 per day for 31.6 days on hand; Corvale General holds 493 tablets at 18.9 per day for 26.1 days on hand; Corvale Lakeside holds 76 tablets at 5.5 per day for 13.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General also holds 512 units of the 5 mg/5 mL solution at 19.5 per day for 26.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A product label for oxycodone and acetaminophen names Bryant Ranch Prepack as the plant (FEI 1000519407) with operations RELABEL and REPACK and a last inspection classification of VAI on 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that plant show an OAI classification from an inspection ending 2009-06-11 and a VAI classification from the most recent inspection ending 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Alvogen, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the Bryant Ranch Prepack supply chain is affecting your current stock and evaluate the alternate manufacturers Alvogen, Inc., Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, and Amneal Pharmaceuticals of New York LLC for availability.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7", "D8"]
    }
  ]
}
